# Croatian digits per the 2020 standard (Funtek): standard form is numsign(3456)+a-j;
# these lowered forms are marked noback so they never hijack back-translation of
# punctuation (dots-2 = comma, 25 = colon, ...).
noback digit 1 2
noback digit 2 23
noback digit 3 25
noback digit 4 256
noback digit 5 26
noback digit 6 235
noback digit 7 2356
noback digit 8 236
noback digit 9 35
noback digit 0 356
